{"panneau":"fenetres","panneauNom":"Le minuteur de fenêtre","passages":[{"id":151,"page":"fenetres.html","ancre":"fenetres","titre":"Le minuteur de fenêtre — les délais qui se ferment, et les silences","panneau":"Le minuteur de fenêtre","texte":"§L29 Le minuteur de fenêtre — les délais qui se ferment, et les silences Les droits meurent souvent par délai : une fenêtre d’appel, un téléchargement qui expire, un refus d’arbitrage qui se perd. Ce minuteur prend les fenêtres des fiches et du registre des conditions — chacune avec sa source — calcule la date limite depuis ta date de départ, et la scelle comme échéance dans ton cerveau, avec un rappel .ics local. Et là où le contrat ne dit rien, le minuteur dit le silence : un silence écrit comme un silence est aussi une information — il te dit que ta protection est la demande écrite, pas l’horloge de la plateforme. Les fenêtres, avec leurs sources Choisis une fenêtre Facebook — appel d’une désactivation : 180 jours Instagram — appel : aucun délai établi (silence) X — restauration après désactivation : 30 jours X — appel d’une suspension : aucun délai au contrat (silence) TikTok — bannissement d’âge (général) : 113 jours pour contester et télécharger TikTok — bannissement d’âge (EEE/R.-U./Suisse) : 180 jours TikTok — bannissement d’âge (É.-U.) : 23 jours TikTok — fichier d’export téléchargeable : 4 jours Snapchat — plainte au contrat : six mois Discord — réception du paquet d’export : 30 jours Discord — refus de l’arbitrage (opt-out) : 30 jours Discord — délai pour agir : 1 an YouTube — appel : 1 an, 2 appels au plus Meta — délai de réponse aux demandes : aucun délai unique (silence) Date de départ (format aaaa-mm-jj) — la mesure, la notification, l’envoi Format : aaaa-mm-jj (par exemple 2026-11-07). Sceller cette échéance dans mon cerveau Télécharger le rappel (.ics) Le bouton du rappel (.ics) est désactivé tant qu'aucune échéance n'est calculée : choisis une fenêtre et une date de départ ci-dessus — dès que l'échéance s'affiche, le bouton s'active et le rappel porte cette date-là. Le calcul est une addition droite de jours à la date de départ — il ne remplace pas le texte source : chaque fenêtre porte sa source, et les fenêtres de pages d’aide sont nommées comme telles, distinctes du contrat.","mots":["l29","le","minuteur","de","fenetre","les","delais","qui","se","ferment","et","les","silences","les","droits","meurent","souvent","par","delai","une","fenetre","d","appel","un","telechargement","qui","expire","un","refus","d","arbitrage","qui","se","perd","ce","minuteur","prend","les","fenetres","des","fiches","et","du","registre","des","conditions","chacune","avec","sa","source","calcule","la","date","limite","depuis","ta","date","de","depart","et","la","scelle","comme","echeance","dans","ton","cerveau","avec","un","rappel","ics","local","et","la","ou","le","contrat","ne","dit","rien","le","minuteur","dit","le","silence","un","silence","ecrit","comme","un","silence","est","aussi","une","information","il","te","dit","que","ta","protection","est","la","demande","ecrite","pas","l","horloge","de","la","plateforme","les","fenetres","avec","leurs","sources","choisis","une","fenetre","facebook","appel","d","une","desactivation","180","jours","instagram","appel","aucun","delai","etabli","silence","x","restauration","apres","desactivation","30","jours","x","appel","d","une","suspension","aucun","delai","au","contrat","silence","tiktok","bannissement","d","age","general","113","jours","pour","contester","et","telecharger","tiktok","bannissement","d","age","eee","r","u","suisse","180","jours","tiktok","bannissement","d","age","e","u","23","jours","tiktok","fichier","d","export","telechargeable","4","jours","snapchat","plainte","au","contrat","six","mois","discord","reception","du","paquet","d","export","30","jours","discord","refus","de","l","arbitrage","opt-out","30","jours","discord","delai","pour","agir","1","an","youtube","appel","1","an","2","appels","au","plus","meta","delai","de","reponse